        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our cost matrix offers tiered pricing based on truck size, distance, and service level. For a low‑budget move, you can opt for a 18‑ft container truck with basic packing, which starts at a competitive rate inclusive of GST and insurance, while still meeting safety standards.</p>
