        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. We are IBA‑approved, hold ISO 9001:2015 certification, and comply with all e‑Way bill regulations. This ensures that our operations meet national standards for quality, safety, and financial transparency, giving you confidence in our Kankarbagh relocation services.</p>
